'''Pokémon Concierge''' (Japanese: '''ポケモンコンシェルジュ''' ''Pokémon Concierge'') is a {{wp|Stop motion|stop-motion}} {{pkmn|animation|animated}} series produced by [https://dw-f.jp/english/ dwarf studios] as a collaborative production between [[Netflix]] and [[The Pokémon Company]]. The initial run consisted of four episodes, which were released worldwide on December 28, 2023 on Netflix.<ref>[https://about.netflix.com/en/news/pokemon-concierge-main-trailer Sunny Skies and Bright Smiles: Stop-Motion Series ‘Pokémon Concierge’ Premieres on December 28 - About Netflix]</ref> A second batch of four episodes was released worldwide on September 4, 2025 on Netflix.<ref>[https://about.netflix.com/en/news/pokemon-concierge-new-episodes Take a Trip Back to the Pokémon Resort: Stop-motion Series ‘Pokémon Concierge’ Continues This September - About Netflix]</ref>

It was announced on February 27, 2023 during a [[Pokémon Presents]] as part of [[Pokémon Day]].<ref>[https://press.pokemon.com/en/releases/Pokemon-Day-2023-Announcement Pokémon Continues to Evolve with New Game Experiences, Entertainment, and Products Revealed for 2023 on Pokémon Day - The Pokémon Company North America Official Press Site]</ref><ref>[https://about.netflix.com/news/netflix-pokemon-concierge Netflix and The Pokémon Company Team Up for Brand New Stop-Motion Series 'Pokémon Concierge' - About Netflix]</ref> On February 19, 2024, the official Pokémon Twitter account announced that additional episodes were currently in production.<ref>[https://twitter.com/Pokemon/status/1759714771555803492 Exciting news, Trainers! New episodes of Pokémon Concierge are in production! Stay tuned for updates! - Pokémon on Twitter]</ref> From February 21 to March 9, 2025, episodes from Part 1 were made available on the various official Pokémon [[YouTube]] channels as a part of [[Pokémon Day#2025|Pokémon Day 2025]] celebrations. On February 27, 2025, during a Pokémon Presents as part of Pokémon Day, it was announced that the second batch of episodes will be released on Netflix in September 2025. On July 22, 2025, a new trailer was shown during Pokémon Presents.

It features a concierge at the [[Pokémon Resort]], [[Haru]], and her interactions with Pokémon and their {{pkmn|Trainer}}s visiting the resort as guests.

==Blurb==
<i>Welcome to Pokémon Resort, a peaceful getaway for Pokémon to relax and have fun. Which adorable guest will the new concierge Haru befriend and help first?</i>

